s=\"strong\">Bill</span>: Well, evening work is difficult. Our employees want to spend time with their families.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: What are you suggesting?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: I'm suggesting that our employees should finish work at 5 p.m. I believe our company employees don't need to work the night shift. Paula, what do you think?<br/>", "id": 2, "time": "7000", "image": "engenn2le08ob08re2img03.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: I have to look at the numbers. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: I think it is important. Get back to me ASAP.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: I don't know if the company can afford it.", "id": 3, "time": "26500", "image": "engenn2le08ob08re2img02.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn2le08ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">Formal e-mail</span>", "id": 1, "time": "5000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">E-mail structure</span>", "id": 2, "time": "10000", "image": ""}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can write a short, formal e-mail.  "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can politely disagree with colleagues. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can politely give my opinion."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What are some polite ways to disagree with someone? "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Can you use these phrases at work? Why or why not?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Y